	(text "OUTPUTS (x4): BTS3256D HITFET low-side, 7.5A nom, 12kHz max PWM, internal 40V active clamp.\n3.3k series (fault readback), 100k pulldown holds OFF in reset. SRP open = fast slew; fit R38-41 to slow edges.\nLoad current returns via J1 pins 2+24."
